{"id":"chatcmpl-2130d319-93cd-476a-a21e-58929db7f821","object":"chat.completion","created":1795245787,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"{\n  \"highlights\": \"When visual evidence is ambiguous and multiple expert tools disagree, the successful strategy was to gather independent opinions from diverse models, explicitly surface conflicts, and use a verification step to audit the evidence before committing to an answer. The pattern emphasizes triangulation and conflict resolution rather than relying on a single source.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When initial expert analysis conflicts with available options, seek multiple independent opinions from diverse tools to triangulate the correct finding.\",\n    \"Explicitly document and verify conflicting tool outputs before finalizing an answer, especially when the evidence is ambiguous.\",\n    \"Use a verification step to audit the consistency of evidence and resolve disagreements among sources.\",\n    \"When laterality or location is unclear, ask targeted questions that force tools to distinguish between specific options (e.g., left vs right, upper vs lower).\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical Imaging Interpretation\": \"Gather at least three independent expert opinions, note disagreements, and use a verifier to confirm the most consistent finding.\",\n    \"Ambiguous Evidence Resolution\": \"When sources conflict, ask each source to justify its answer with specific features, then compare the reasoning across sources.\",\n    \"Multi-Source Decision Making\": \"Weight the majority opinion but require verification when the stakes are high or the evidence is weak.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm that at least two independent sources agree on the key finding (e.g., location and laterality).\",\n    \"Verify that the final answer is supported by the majority of expert opinions and that conflicts have been explicitly addressed.\"\n  ]\n}"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":832,"total_tokens":1158,"completion_tokens":326,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":832},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":326}}}